  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connecting Communities:Digital Public Service Transformation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNJP aims at creating the conditions to foster digital transformation in Mozambique through (i) a comprehensive assessment of the country&#x2019;s digital public ecosystem and (ii) the implementation of a pilot to increase connectivity and access to digital services at district level, while immersing local communities in the use of digital services. The project prioritizes gender equality by addressing barriers faced by women and girls, promoting digital literacy, and enhancing their representation</narrative>
  </description>
